{"c":[{"id":"31d09dcbe08a45f9","sum":"L1/P1: Gemma E2B base model (few-shot local drafts, grammar required, deadlineMs epoch ms); labelTooLong over 80-char focused labels on low-prose pages; old hosts throw on unknown memoryDocument ids; no-groq.ts fails tests reading GROQ_API_KEY.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"227c87230dc71c8a","sum":"L1: Gemma E2B is a base model (local draft prompts are few-shot; caret-local-model refuses a request with no grammar; deadlineMs is epoch ms). Fill throws labelTooLong for a focused label over 80 chars on a page with little prose.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261005T201333Z-fdcac01d5471b677","text":"L1: Cotypist's Gemma E2B is a base model, so local draft prompts are few-shot documents (writer/local-draft.ts); caret-local-model refuses a request with no grammar. localTextRequest.deadlineMs is epoch ms, not a duration.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T204550Z-12e324b0b44784bf","text":"Fill throws labelTooLong when the focused field's label is over 80 chars on a page with little other prose (privacy prose share); saved answers can't be offered there.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"b818cff7ff0f8991","sum":"Hosts before v2/answers throw on an unknown memoryDocument id (answers.md is listed only to savedAnswers hosts). P1: test/setup/no-groq.ts fails any test reading process.env.GROQ_API_KEY; pass explicit env objects in tests.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261005T204550Z-3e3d4d7a0bdec136","text":"Hosts before v2/answers throw on an unknown memoryDocument id, losing the whole memory list; the server lists answers.md only to hosts with the savedAnswers capability.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T205140Z-7ef033e31edcf1b4","text":"P1: helper/test/setup/no-groq.ts (vitest setupFiles) fails any test file that reads process.env.GROQ_API_KEY, even if the throw is caught; pass explicit env objects to readKey/writersOnStart in tests.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"987201798448cfb5","sum":"P1/P2: recheckFill refused W4 Greenhouse whole (derived Country, no label context); add new Ask makers to planAsk's one-answer gate; parts from a 'Label:' line carry it as context; page-link patches verified writes into the last walk.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"091da897e0ecfee3","sum":"P1: recheckFill refused W4 Greenhouse Fill all whole (Country is a derived part; a control with no label context needs a line equal to its span). The heads Ask maker is one answer: planAsk gates it like the writer; add a new maker name to that gate.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261005T205140Z-d6ebebc54b7a4ea1","text":"P1: on W4's saved Greenhouse pages Fill all is refused whole by recheckFill (offers/fill-popup.ts ~218): Country 'United States' is a derived part of 'Location: Oakland, California, United States (...)', and a control without label context needs a line equal to the span.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T205140Z-f4ebc7703c97844e","text":"P1: the heads Ask maker (planner/intent-heads.ts) is one answer, so planAsk gates it like the writer (oneAnswer = makerName !== 'jev': inferredAll, listsAll, confirmScope); a new maker name must be added to that gate or its scope stands unconfirmed.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"0584c276559db78d","sum":"P2: a part from one 'Label: value' line carries that label as context; recheckFields drops only failing fields; an unlabelled span in a longer line passes only if derive.ts re-derives it. page-link patches a verified write into the last walk, then walks once later.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261005T220819Z-519d2cf2c3af807c","text":"P2: a fill part derived from one 'Label: value' line carries that label as FillHandoff.context; recheckFields drops a field that fails its recheck and runs the rest; an unlabelled span inside a longer line passes only if derive.ts re-derives it (fill-popup.ts sourceHolds).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T220819Z-878907191e2eb647","text":"P2: engines/page-link.ts no longer walks after a verified pageWrite/pageSelect/pageSetChecked; it patches that control in the tab's last walk and walks once TRAILING_WALK_MS after the last act. Tests that expected a pageWalk after an ok write must expect the patch.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
